      "content": "thanks, that helps a lot. but i'm worried about the pushback from the people who live in the outskirts or the more suburban areas. i pretty much know they're gonna say that they can't just rely on a subway that might not even reach them, and that they need their cars to get to work or take their kids to school. how do i deal with them saying that highway expansion is a necessity for their lives and not just a \"waste\"?",
